647988,Pocong Pasti Berlalu,Pocong Pasti Berlalu,2014-03-27,2014,0.0,0.0,0.24,"The story begins with some students who live in Pak Bolot's boarding house, they are Remon, Dede, Dion, Radit and two beautiful girls Tata and Dila. In addition to lectures to supplement the necessities of life in Jakarta Remon works as a corpse makeup, while Dion and Tata work part-time as film extras.  After shooting the film Dion and Tata came home, in the middle of the trip right in a bend Dion and Tata saw a motorcyclist lying on the side of the road like a hit-and-run victim and they certainly wanted to help but when they heard the voices of residents who came Dion and Tata decided to leave but before leaving without Tata's knowledge, Dion took the necklace box lying near the victim.  The next day Remon invited Dion and Radit to accompany him to make up the corpse that had just died. How shocked Dion was when he learned that the corpse that Remon had composed was the corpse he had found last night with Tata.","Komedi, Kengerian",Nayato Fio Nuala,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0m1bTCb8sQRwYY5XXh6cpAGyDO.jpg,,78,Released,"Mitra Pictures, BIC Pictures",,,,,,,Pocong Pasti Berlalu,"The story begins with some students who live in Pak Bolot's boarding house, they are Remon, Dede, Dion, Radit and two beautiful girls Tata and Dila. In addition to lectures to supplement the necessities of life in Jakarta Remon works as a corpse makeup, while Dion and Tata work part-time as film extras.  After shooting the film Dion and Tata came home, in the middle of the trip right in a bend Dion and Tata saw a motorcyclist lying on the side of the road like a hit-and-run victim and they certainly wanted to help but when they heard the voices of residents who came Dion and Tata decided to leave but before leaving without Tata's knowledge, Dion took the necklace box lying near the victim.  The next day Remon invited Dion and Radit to accompany him to make up the corpse that had just died. How shocked Dion was when he learned that the corpse that Remon had composed was the corpse he had found last night with Tata.",https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0m1bTCb8sQRwYY5XXh6cpAGyDO.jpg,,,,
591415,Pocong the Origin,Pocong the Origin,2019-04-18,2019,7.0,5.0,0.19,"Ananta, pembunuh berdarah dingin telah dieksekusi mati oleh Negara. Sasthi, putri satu-satunya, harus mengantarkan jenazah sang ayah untuk dikuburkan di kampung halamannya. Dengan ditemani Yama, sipir penjara, keduanya berpacu dengan waktu untuk mencapai kampung Ananta. Hal ini menjadi semakin sulit karna berbagai gangguan gaib menghalangi mereka di sepanjang perjalanan.",Kengerian,Monty Tiwa,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cv0mml6d0dDE2BEXwVX8rD0dZ1V.jpg,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aT1D9697nijCJY2FYwYypxL8Eqa.jpg,91,Released,Starvision Plus,,,,,,,Pocong the Origin,"Ananta, pembunuh berdarah dingin telah dieksekusi mati oleh Negara. Sasthi, putri satu-satunya, harus mengantarkan jenazah sang ayah untuk dikuburkan di kampung halamannya. Dengan ditemani Yama, sipir penjara, keduanya berpacu dengan waktu untuk mencapai kampung Ananta. Hal ini menjadi semakin sulit karna berbagai gangguan gaib menghalangi mereka di sepanjang perjalanan.",https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cv0mml6d0dDE2BEXwVX8rD0dZ1V.jpg,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aT1D9697nijCJY2FYwYypxL8Eqa.jpg,,,
670265,Pocong vs Kuntilanak,Pocong vs Kuntilanak,2008-11-06,2008,7.2,4.0,0.07,"The film starts in the Dutch Colonial Era of Indonesia, where we are informed of Raden Soekotjo's feelings toward Nyi Soroh. As the film opens, Raden is going to Nyi's house to tell her of his feelings for her. She however, has already fallen in love and married a Dutch sea captain named Von Klingen. Angered by that prospect, Raden killed Nyi, which awakened her family's Kuntilanak spirit guardian. Heading after Von Klingen next, Raden became when he found out that the Kuntilanak was after him. He tries to escape, but the Kuntilanak kills him. Before death however, Raden tells one of his relatives not to undo the rope around his pocong shroud, which would allow him to turn into a Pocong spirit.",Kengerian,David Poernomo,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zErAEcE3JAZniC10S6cyqLjjnsS.jpg,,90,Released,Mitra Pictures,,,,,,,Pocong vs Kuntilanak,"The film starts in the Dutch Colonial Era of Indonesia, where we are informed of Raden Soekotjo's feelings toward Nyi Soroh. As the film opens, Raden is going to Nyi's house to tell her of his feelings for her. She however, has already fallen in love and married a Dutch sea captain named Von Klingen. Angered by that prospect, Raden killed Nyi, which awakened her family's Kuntilanak spirit guardian. Heading after Von Klingen next, Raden became when he found out that the Kuntilanak was after him. He tries to escape, but the Kuntilanak kills him. Before death however, Raden tells one of his relatives not to undo the rope around his pocong shroud, which would allow him to turn into a Pocong spirit.",https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zErAEcE3JAZniC10S6cyqLjjnsS.jpg,,,,
568709,Preman Pensiun,Preman Pensiun,2019-01-17,2019,6.4,9.0,0.33,"Gobang kembali ke Bandung, mengundang teman-temannya, para mantan preman untuk bertemu kembali. Mereka yang diundang adalah Ujang, Murad, Pipit, Cecep, Bohim, Mang Uu, Dikdik dan Joni. Dikdik kemudian tidak jadi datang karena masalah dengan istrinya.  Dalam pertemuan yang disebut “reuni kecil-kecilan” itu, Gobang meminta bantuan teman-temannya untuk melakukan penyelidikan, siapa pelaku pembantaian terhadap adik iparnya hingga tewas. Pelaku pembantaian kemudian diketahui adalah Darman dan kawan-kawan yang hanya sebagai orang suruhan. Dalang di balik kejadian itu ternyata teman mereka sendiri, sesama bekas anak buah Muslihat yang sebenarnya juga sudah pensiun. Muslihat mencoba mencegah terjadinya perang saudara, tapi Gobang sudah terlanjur datang dengan membawa dendam, “darah dibayar darah, nyawa dibayar nyaw.","Komedi, Drama",Aris Nugraha,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xfWyoz4SF5LHZ713eMtC2aZ0lT.jpg,https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uJvzFtCyJS9G8sUMy6KlzE3aonA.jpg,95,Released,"MNC Pictures, ANP Films",,,,,,,Preman Pensiun,"Gobang kembali ke Bandung, mengundang teman-temannya, para mantan preman untuk bertemu kembali. Mereka yang diundang adalah Ujang, Murad, Pipit, Cecep, Bohim, Mang Uu, Dikdik dan Joni. Dikdik kemudian tidak jadi datang karena masalah dengan istrinya.  Dalam pertemuan yang disebut “reuni kecil-kecilan” itu, Gobang meminta bantuan teman-temannya untuk melakukan penyelidikan, siapa pelaku pembantaian terhadap adik iparnya hingga tewas. Pelaku pembantaian kemudian diketahui adalah Darman dan kawan-kawan yang hanya sebagai orang suruhan. Dalang di balik kejadian itu ternyata teman mereka sendiri, sesama bekas anak buah Muslihat yang sebenarnya juga sudah pensiun. Muslihat mencoba mencegah terjadinya perang saudara, tapi Gobang sudah terlanjur datang dengan membawa dendam, “darah dibayar darah, nyawa dibayar nyaw.",https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xfWyoz4SF5LHZ713eMtC2aZ0lT.jpg,https: